n">ho ra ma do no so to</span></p><p begin="00:25.055" end="00:28.634" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:25.055" end="00:26.444">何</span><span begin="00:26.444" end="00:26.764">が</span><span begin="00:26.764" end="00:27.592">見</span><span begin="00:27.592" end="00:27.846">え</span><span begin="00:27.846" end="00:28.634">た？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">看到了什么呢?</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na ni ga mi e ta</span></p><p begin="00:37.617" end="00:41.228" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:37.617" end="00:38.283">遠</span><span begin="00:38.283" end="00:38.483">い</span><span begin="00:38.483" end="00:39.643">星</span><span begin="00:39.643" end="00:39.913">の</span><span begin="00:39.913" end="00:40.430">空</span><span begin="00:40.430" end="00:41.228">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在那遥远的星空</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">to o i ho shi no so ra ni</span></p><p begin="00:42.075" end="00:46.132" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:42.075" end="00:42.667">十</span><span begin="00:42.667" end="00:43.218">五</span><span begin="00:43.218" end="00:44.078">夜</span><span begin="00:44.078" end="00:44.330">は</span><span begin="00:44.330" end="00:45.127">満ち</span><span begin="00:45.127" end="00:46.132">欠け</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">十五的月亮 还是有圆缺</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ju u go ya wa mi chi ka ke</span></p><p begin="00:46.608" end="00:49.966" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:46.608" end="00:48.440">懐かしい</span><span begin="00:48.440" end="00:49.004">歌</span><span begin="00:49.004" end="00:49.966">声</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在这令人怀念的歌声中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">na tsu ka shi i u ta go e</span></p><p begin="00:50.894" end="00:55.322" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:50.894" end="00:52.119">眠り</span><span begin="00:52.119" end="00:52.794">に</span><span begin="00:52.794" end="00:53.079">つ</span><span begin="00:53.079"